{"title":"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Inside square <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> with side <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, quarter-circle arcs with radii <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> and centers at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> are drawn. These arcs intersect at a point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> inside the square. How far is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> from the side of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/4/0948661e822f2a953c43a57ac9e40b2734476de4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/3/45378b2157971019776ca6281587ebc601289b2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } \\tfrac{1}{2} s(\\sqrt{3}+4)\\quad \\text{(B) } \\tfrac{1}{2} s\\sqrt{3}\\quad \\text{(C) } \\tfrac{1}{2} s(1+\\sqrt{3})\\quad \\text{(D) } \\tfrac{1}{2} s(\\sqrt{3}-1)\\quad \\text{(E) } \\tfrac{1}{2} s(2-\\sqrt{3})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"616\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>All answers are proportional to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, so for ease, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/1/fb16e2177f55574e2538c0d9b240b1ee7d46d767.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> be oriented so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/c/e1ca02ce61393b087f4d0688e813e6f53edf8c45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A(0, 0), B(1, 0), C(1, 1), D(0, 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"242\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>The circle centered at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> with radius <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/986caeeb8fd9e1d6641ebfb76ebfd81618e1f7df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 + y^2 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"89\" height=\"18\" />.  The circle centered at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> with radius <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/0928e424f36d713e70e7dae84585154450bd0913.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x - 1)^2 + y^2 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"135\" height=\"19\" />.  Solving each equation for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/8/008f31b03b8513b66fb2884b90ac118d6bdf05f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 - y^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"47\" height=\"18\" /> to find the intersection leads to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/7/cb72085c3fa169b22d9d35c74f9c6f6179d322aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x - 1)^2 = x^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"104\" height=\"19\" />, which leads to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/f/a2ff20448834be77dc325234211669d2b44d35aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>Plugging that back in to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/986caeeb8fd9e1d6641ebfb76ebfd81618e1f7df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 + y^2 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"89\" height=\"18\" /> leads to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/c/b6c6a3101e36b73367f97f3b37a8a277b2b4c2f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^2 = 1 - \\frac{1}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"84\" height=\"37\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/d/bcd6ca590e25d145ff7884b856fbf9981d9770eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\pm \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"74\" height=\"41\" />.  Since we want the intersection within the square where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/4/5f4f6945fad65262f4aa188982b41a0123718d3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 &lt; x, y &lt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"93\" height=\"16\" />, we take the positive solution, and the intersection is at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/8/9883762a0bdb0f817da1ee0f39f9d56cefc60b2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X(\\frac{1}{2}, \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"78\" height=\"41\" />.\n</p><p>The distance from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> to side <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/4/0948661e822f2a953c43a57ac9e40b2734476de4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />, which lies along the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/3/6c3b4834614e5e7e189cb7d621cfb4fb0bd36dd7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />, is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/4/744f771c452d4382794673a49a831174bcc8ad05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 - \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"58\" height=\"41\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/d/69d4626fa20b4f888b323ff74b7e5b38e8e0bd8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2  -\\sqrt{3}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"58\" height=\"41\" />.  This is answer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/e/62effaf0d5dc9bfa1d137bed40c4baa73698962d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/1/fb16e2177f55574e2538c0d9b240b1ee7d46d767.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME\" title=\"1970 AHSME\">1970 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1970 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1970\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <